OL,3,GNEWSATown's 'little bit of magic'
OL,4,Ahailed in culture bid
OL,5,
OL,6,FBlackpool has "that little bit of
OL,7,Fmagic" which could help it win the UK
OL,8,FCity of Culture 2029 competition and
OL,9,F"turbo-charge" the town, its
OL,10,Fregeneration director has said.
OL,12,FThe seaside resort is one of nine
OL,13,Fplaces which made the long list for the
OL,14,Ftitle after the Department of Culture,
OL,15,FMedia and Sport (DCMS) also encouraged
OL,16,Flarger towns to bid.
OL,18,FAs the 45th largest place in the UK,
OL,19,Fwith a population of 141,500 and a
OL,20,Fvisitor economy valued at #2bn, the
OL,21,Ftown met the DCMS bidding criteria.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
