OL,3,GNEWSATown's 'little bit of magic'
OL,4,Ahailed in culture bid
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlan Cavill from Blackpool Council
OL,7,Fsaid: "I think we've got something just
OL,8,Fa little bit different... that little
OL,9,Fbit of magic that we've got, really
OL,10,Fmakes a difference in terms of the
OL,11,Fcompetition."
